    "summary": "Cabal of Sorcerers applies to a Thousand Sons army as its Shooting phase opens. Choose an eligible model and a Ritual, then make that model’s Psychic test. This turn, the model must have tried no Ritual and your army must have made no attempt at the selected Ritual. Destiny’s Ruin and Twist of Fate pick a visible enemy within 24\" of the caster through phase end. Against the first target, reroll Hit rolls showing 1, or reroll any Hit roll if the test reaches 10+. Attacks against the second gain 1 AP, or 2 at 12+. Both benefits apply to your Thousand Sons and Scintillating Legions models. Temporal Surge picks an unengaged friendly unit from either group, visible to the caster and within 24\". It can move normally up to D6\", or up to 6\" if the test reaches 10+. In either case it cannot charge this turn.",
